  m_text: '1. When you shoot, will accumulate enegry. Enegry is full, click the button
    to summon the Electric Cannon, cause a large-range attack.

    2. The energy
    will be converted according to the proportion of the bet&discharge is according
    to the current bet. The energy will be cleared after the discharge is completed.

    3.
    24 hours after the player leaves the game or disconnects from the game,the anger
    will be cleared.'
